**Root cause:** Every test follows the same template — call the method, maybe `Assert.IsNotNull`, done. This gives 95% line coverage (every branch is *executed*) but near-0% *behavioral* coverage (no outputs are verified). A bug in price calculation, CSV formatting, or delete logic would pass the entire suite.
